            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Kannada for empowerment, then the Kannada for commitment."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ಚುನಾವಣೆ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಚುನಾವಣೆ — cunāvaṇe — \"an election\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮುಂದಿನ ತಿಂಗಳು ನಮ್ಮ ಊರಿನಲ್ಲಿ ಚುನಾವಣೆ ಇದೆ. mundina tiṅgaḷu namma ūrinalli cunāvaṇe ide. There is an election in our town next month."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಚುನಾವಣೆಗೆ ನಿಲ್ಲು, to stand for election."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಚುನಾವಣೆ (cunāvaṇe) is a loan from Hindustani cunāv, \"a choosing, an election\", from cunnā, \"to pick\", with a Kannada noun ending."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
