        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ಮತ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮತ — mata — \"a vote\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹದಿನೆಂಟು ವರ್ಷ ತುಂಬಿದವರಿಗೆ ಮತ ಹಾಕುವ ಹಕ್ಕು ಇದೆ. hadineṇṭu varṣa tumbidavarige mata hākuva hakku ide. Those who have turned eighteen have the right to vote."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮತ (mata) ಹಾಕು, to cast a vote. It also means an opinion or a creed."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮತ (mata) is borrowed from Sanskrit mata, \"thought, opinion\" (Monier-Williams), from man, \"to think\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
